	)
	(text "SD: low switches the amplifier off. R_SD (10k) keeps it off\nuntil the processor drives it high (silence at start-up).\nJP_GAIN open = 9 dB gain; to ground = 12 dB; to +5V = 6 dB\n(per the Adafruit description; check on a clone module).\nSpeaker: wires from the module terminal to J_SPK_M, then to the main connector."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 50.8 0)
		(effects
